{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the free demo for Hot Wax, the\u00a0falling-block puzzle game where you place candles and then light them up to create slowly-unfolding chain reactions in a gloomy temple built to some unholy creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the first difficulty for two of the full game's six gamemodes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt; In Ritual, reach a score of 6,666 to summon the temple's god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt; In Penance, puzzle away a mass of candles that periodically keeps growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A run typically lasts a couple of minutes. This demo version has the first 6 unlockable colour palettes of the full game's 29. This demo also has 4 exclusive achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your save for the demo will be compatible with the full game, so you will keep your unlocks and highscores.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just Visiting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274270/d6a3b6ad120d0cc7877fe6918aca7cb605ebe4f5.jpg"},{"name":"Don't You Hate When All The Grey Goo Spills Everywhere?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274270/56138920e0ce9eb2ff880f0a9e5a87564c490780.jpg"},{"name":"Efficient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274270/01863bc314414f0d8820f9874cff18a812dafb36.jpg"},{"name":"Paint Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274270/b5c5ebe7569b94b0c3b6cd7b0ecb86c3cfaffb3d.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274270?t=1740581759","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274270?t=1740581759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274270/2b252bee81d3c7c22b5238c83af97935d6f4be89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740581759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274270/2b252bee81d3c7c22b5238c83af97935d6f4be89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740581759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the free demo for Hot Wax, the\u00a0falling-block puzzle game where you place candles and then light them up to create slowly-unfolding chain reactions in a gloomy temple built to some unholy creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the first difficulty for two of the full game's six gamemodes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt; In Ritual, reach a score of 6,666 to summon the temple's god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt; In Penance, puzzle away a mass of candles that periodically keeps growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A run typically lasts a couple of minutes. This demo version has the first 6 unlockable colour palettes of the full game's 29. This demo also has 4 exclusive achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your save for the demo will be compatible with the full game, so you will keep your unlocks and highscores.</p>","developers":["PUNKCAKE D\u00e9licieux"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3041750","name":"Hot Wax"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274270/header.jpg?t=1740581759","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any 64-bit distro</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cl